---
description: Extract helpers and long effect setup into a colocated helpers.ts.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Helpers live in helpers.ts

Keep the component file as wiring + JSX. Move non-render logic to a **colocated** `helpers.ts` next to the component (e.g. `components/map/helpers.ts`). Do not pile a global `src/helpers.ts`.

Extract:

- Pure helpers (`localeBag`, `placePins`)
- One-off controls/classes
- Long `useEffect` bodies: mount, listeners, cleanup

The component should call a named helper, not inline a 40-line effect.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — mount logic inside the component
useEffect(() => {
  const map = new MlMap({ container: root, /* ... */ });
  map.addControl(/* ... */);
  map.on("load", () => { /* pins, fitBounds, tone */ });
  const ro = new ResizeObserver(() => map.resize());
  return () => {
    ro.disconnect();
    map.remove();
  };
}, []);

// ✅ GOOD — component wires; helpers.ts owns setup
useEffect(() => mountKrakowMap({ root, mapRef, markersRef, /* ... */ }), []);
```

`mountKrakowMap` creates the map, controls, load handler, resize observer, and returns the cleanup.
